# RaceDay Part 2 - Implemented Endpoints

## 1. Auth - Session based with Role
- POST /api/auth/register - Register with role (Organiser/Participant), BCrypt hash
- POST /api/auth/login - Login, store UserID and Role in session
- POST /api/auth/logout

## 2. Events - Organiser only for CUD
- GET /api/events - All roles can view
- GET /api/events/{id}
- POST /api/events - Organiser only
- PUT /api/events/{id} - Organiser only
- DELETE /api/events/{id} - Organiser only

## 3. Categories
- GET /api/categories/event/{eventId}
- POST /api/categories - Organiser

## 4. Enrolments - Participant enters
- POST /api/enrolments - Participant enters event by category
- GET /api/enrolments/my - My enrolments
- GET /api/enrolments/event/{eventId} - Organiser view

## 5. Results - Organiser captures
- POST /api/results - Organiser
- GET /api/results/event/{eventId} - All roles

## 6. Users
- GET /api/users/profile
- PUT /api/users/profile

## Roles
- Organiser: Manages events, categories, results
- Participant: Views events, enrols, views results

## Security
- Session authentication
- Role-based authorization check in every Organiser endpoint
- BCrypt password hashing

